+### Product storage conditions: done, 2026-10-21
+
+- `Product.storage_conditions` (CharField 250, default "") + `ProductTranslation.storage_conditions` (nullable), migration `0211_product_storage_conditions`.
+- GraphQL: `Product`, `ProductInput`/`ProductCreateInput`/`ProductBulkCreateInput`, `ProductTranslation`, `ProductTranslatableContent`, shared `TranslationInput`; `categoryTranslate`/`collectionTranslate` reject it (`INVALID`); `ProductFieldEnum.STORAGE_CONDITIONS` (CSV export); legacy webhook `PRODUCT_FIELDS`; bulk translate error codes now normalised via `get_error_code_from_error`.
+- Tests: `test_product_storage_conditions.py`, `test_product_storage_conditions_translate.py`, csv/webhook test updates.
+
